label story_02_complete (An Ill Omen Complete)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): Ten shadows have fallen into the soil. Their silence is not peace. It is patience. The dark is counting what it lost.
"Dianthus Core": Moonspore clings to their remains. Even void-born things carry traces of night-blooming life, as if hunger alone cannot erase what once grew.
"Dianthus Core": Follow those traces to Dusk Forest. Do not fear its darkness just because the Void wears a darker face.
"Dianthus Core": The forest may remember what the meadow cannot. Go carefully, little alchemist. Learn what still blooms when the sun looks away.
[signal arg="quest_start:story_03_journey"]
[end_timeline]
